pe/Annot>>endobj1661 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 1660 0 R/Rect[363.57 531.533 547.511 712.847]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj1662 0 obj<</BBox[0.0 0.0 24.0 24.0]/Filter/FlateDecode/Length 257/Resources<</ExtGState<</GS0<</AIS false/BM/Normal/CA 0.6/Type/ExtGState/ca 0.6>>>>>>/Subtype/Form/Type/XObject>>stream
